<title>UK: Rabobank sets C$100 mln Dec 2002 bond. [CORRECTED 13:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets C$100 mln Dec 2002 bond. [CORRECTED 13:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.70    PAY DATE  L-09.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.10    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10    SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHER    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275	SELL CONC  1.60     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>(Corrects the issue price from 101.725, the fee split for management and underwriting from 0.25 and the fee split for selling concession from 1.625.)</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT SEPTEMBER 2001 CANADA</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
